 "source": {
  "map": "No map: EMC 16.26.020(D)(1) draws the area in words -- in the Downtown (D) zone, ground floor residential uses may not front Broadway Street, Main Street or OR 224, and are prohibited in all of the zone south of OR 224",
  "quote": "or/clackamas/estacada/16.26/16.26.020.txt#L11,L13-L14",
  "inputs": {
   "zone": "the D polygon of the regional zoning layer (https://maps.orcity.org/arcgis/rest/services/GLADSTONE/Gladstone_LandUseAndPlanning/MapServer/7, CITY='Estacada', ZONE='D'), 62.6 acres, fetched 2026-10-29",
   "taxlots": "Metro RLIS taxlots (https://services2.arcgis.com/McQ0OlIABe29rJJy/arcgis/rest/services/Taxlots_(Public)/FeatureServer/3), fetched 2026-10-29: the 135 lots at least half inside D",
   "streets": "the screen's own street centrelines (quadfit s1_streets): BROADWAY, MAIN, HWY 224, FRONTAGE, CURRIN, ACACIA by name"
  },
  "traced_by": "Claude (districts chunk 5 worker)",
  "traced_on": "2026-10-29",
  "drawn": true,
  "how": "Built from the taxlots, not traced from a picture. From every lot edge a ray was cast outward every 8 ft, 150 ft long; the lot fronts a street when a ray reaches that street's centreline before crossing another taxlot. A D lot is kept when no ray reaches Broadway, Main, OR 224 or the OR 224 frontage road (the frontage road is taken as fronting OR 224, the conservative reading), no ray reaches Currin Street or Acacia Road (16.26.040(H)(2): access there is subject to the South Downtown Circulation and Access Plan, which is not stored), at least one ray reaches some street, it lies at least 90% on the north side of the OR 224 centreline, and it is at least 100 ft from that centreline (OR 224's right-of-way is wide and uneven, so a lot set back from it may still front it). The kept lots are unioned and grown 1 ft so their shared lines close; a lot that was not kept gains a sliver well under the 10% that answers False.",
  "counts": {
   "D_lots": 135,
   "kept": 44,
   "kept_at_or_under_10890_sqft": 29,
   "dropped": {
    "fronts Broadway": 28,
    "fronts Main": 15,
    "fronts OR 224 or its frontage road": 15,
    "fronts two of those": 7,
    "touches Currin": 14,
    "touches Acacia": 2,
    "south of OR 224": 6,
    "within 100 ft of OR 224": 1,
    "reaches no street": 3
   }
  }
 },
